<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108239" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδείδω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> trans., <i>shrink in fear under, cower before,</i> c.
			acc., <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, who uses mostly the aor. (usu. written with
			double <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δϝ</span>, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείδω</span>
			)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὑπέδδεισαν, ὑποδδείσαντες,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.406
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.413
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδείσατε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.66
				</span></i>
			: 
				Ep.
			
			pf.
			<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i> and plpf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδείδια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.564
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Philet.
				8
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεδείδισαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.521
				</span></i>
			: 
				Ep.
			
			pf.
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπαιδείδοικα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					165
				</span></i>
			: literally, of birds, <i>cower beneath,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέγαν αἰγυπιὸν ὑποδείσαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					169
				</span></i>
			 (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			abs., <i>fear,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή τίς μοι ὑποδδείσας ἀναδύη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.377
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδεδοικώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Salt.</u>
					63
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδεδιώς.</span></div>
